### Metadata Server
# User-provided metadata.edn files (keep examples only)
metadata_store/*
!metadata_store/example_template/
!metadata_store/simple_hello/
!metadata_store/agent_demo/
!metadata_store/shared_types_demo/
!metadata_store/provide_delegate_defect/
# Compiled shared-type generations (see afield.SharedTypes) are build output, per document.
metadata_store/*/.field-shared-types/
# Runtime artefacts Field writes into a workspace, and the per-workspace agent guides
# ensureAgentGuides seeds: derived, not part of the demo document.
# The first three are covered repo-wide below; these entries stay because `document.md`,
# `AGENTS.md` and `README.md` are only derived *here*, under metadata_store.
metadata_store/*/backups/
metadata_store/*/history_metrics.edn
metadata_store/*/transcript.edn
metadata_store/*/document.md
metadata_store/*/AGENTS.md
metadata_store/*/README.md

### Field document side-artefacts, anywhere in the tree
# Opening a Field document writes into the directory it came from. `SavingContext.save`
# fans out to seven producers (saving.kt:444-521), and the five below are all derived from
# the two files a document actually is (`metadata.edn` and `document.md`). Committed demo
# documents live inside this repository — `dev_docs/agents/demos/`, `public/docs/assets/` —
# so opening one used to leave four untracked paths in `git status`.
#
# Not scoped to metadata_store/: the rules above cover 5 of the 117 directories holding a
# tracked metadata.edn (`git ls-files '*metadata.edn' | wc -l`), and the demo the docs tell
# you to open is not one of them.
#
# These names collide with nothing else in the tree. Measured 2026-09-05: every tracked path
# matching them (13 files) is itself a spill of exactly this kind, all under
# public/docs/assets/. `.gitignore` does not affect already-tracked files, so those 13 keep
# showing up in a diff, which is the correct outcome — they need deleting, not hiding.
**/backups/
**/history_metrics.edn
**/transcript.edn
**/operations.yaml
**/history_screenshots/

# Telemetry data
metadata_server_telemetry.json

