# Dear ImGui window state. Field never writes this — ImGuiRenderToTexture.kt sets
# io.iniFilename to null — but tools that render their own ImGui overlay into our process
# (NVIDIA Nsight) do, at the working directory. Root-anchored: it is only ever litter here.
/imgui.ini

### Field template backup snapshots
# Two spellings, both real. safeSave writes into `backups` (saving.kt,
# `File(file.parentFile, "backups")`), which the tree-wide `**/backups/` rule above
# already covers. `backup/` is the older spelling and is NOT empty: dropping it
# uncovered 1 003 files across templates/advanced_remote/backup (783) and
# templates/remote/backup (220), measured 2026-09-05 when exactly that happened.
templates/*/backup/
templates/*/backups/

