electron/node_modules/

### Field local HTTPS cert generated by Gradle task
config/field4-local.p12

### Nightly self-improvement scratch (per-branch build artifacts; never belong on main)
# Each nightly build branch writes a root worklog; the flatten in `git pull --rebase`
# would otherwise drag it onto main. Root-anchored so it only affects the repo root.
/NIGHTLY_WORKLOG.md

# The block that used to live here ignored jvmTest's "proof" artifacts at the repo root
# (/*-proof.svg, /sparkline-proof/, /spectral_*_spectrogram.png, fn_fit_montage.png) and said:
# "The real fix is for these tests to render to a temp dir; until then, root-anchored ignores."
# That fix has now landed — see `afield.proofDir` in src/jvmTest/kotlin/afield/TestProofDir.kt —
# so the ignores are gone with the litter they were hiding. Set AFIELD_PROOF_DIR to collect the
# artifacts somewhere deliberate.

### Ad-hoc render output at the repository root
# A box that calls `renderer.captureWindowToFile(outputPath = "bridge-top-assembled.png")` — a bare
# relative path — writes it to the JVM's working directory, which is the checkout root. There is no
# library default to fix here the way `afield.proofDir` fixed jvmTest's proofs: the caller chose the
# path. On 2026-08-25 that had left **68** loose PNGs at the root (angled-section-*, bridge-*,
# collar-*, three-mitre-*, monkeypaw-*, bounded-*, planar-*, house-* and friends, all from the
# rect/house and tessellation work), every one of which showed up in every `git status` and in the
# untracked list of every agent session that read one. Root-anchored, so nothing under
# public/docs/assets/, dev_docs/agents/artifacts/ or templates/ is affected; no tracked file at the
# root is a PNG (tools/test_repository_root_inventory.py holds that down), and `git add -f` still
# works if one ever should be.
/*.png

# Agent scratch and in-progress demo verification, not part of the demo corpus (2026-09-25).
# `test_demo_build_scripts` and `AgentDemoRegistrationTest` enumerate this directory from the
# filesystem, so an untracked folder here reads as an undeclared demo.
dev_docs/agents/demos/.agent-scratch/
dev_docs/agents/demos/ai4_loop_verification/
